  "description": "“A love life? Give me a break.” A complete non-believer when it comes to romance, Eun-Ho is focused on climbing the ladder at work. Smart with excellent social skills to boot, both her bosses and clients love her. But when a new hire suddenly appears in front of her and an old first love start to shake things up again, she can’t help but waver. \n\n(Source: WEBTOON, edited)",
